# Stormworks (CIPlay stormworks): the works plateau at 8 m round 0 0; the hall, note 1, the hall chest, the weather
# room, note 2, its chest, the screechers on the spur, the anchor store on the beach, the rod top, note 3.
island Stormworks
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Works
zone smelter_hall
expect step 1
read Stormworks note 1
expect step 2
open Smelter hall
wait 3
zone weather_room
expect step 4
read Stormworks note 2
expect step 5
open Weather room
wait 3
expect step 6
kill Screecher
expect animals Screecher 0
expect step 7
open Anchor store
wait 3
zone stormridge
expect step 9
read Smelters' roll
use cellarhatch
expect message bolted from below
expect step 10
use cellarlever
expect story cellarpin 1
expect step 11
use cellarhatch
expect shown cellarchest
open Storm cellar
wait 3
expect step 12
zone rod_top
expect step 13
# (deep pass 10-24: the top locker refuses, the dive, the air bell, the dive chest, the buried tins, the tower)
open Chimney locker
expect message casting mould
zone sw_dive
air sw_air
open Quench van
wait 3
expect story mould 1
open Quench strongbox
wait 3
dig 3
climb -22.85 -69.18
open Chimney stash
wait 3
read Smoke cairn
dig 2
zone sw_top
open Chimney locker
wait 3
read Stormworks note 3
dig
expect done
